---
layout: layouts/app.njk
title: Today
description: Scripted math lessons for ages 4 to 7, built on Direct Instruction. You read the script; the child answers.
bodyClass: page-today
eleventyComputed:
  seoTitle: "Math Direct"
---
<header class="screen__head">
  <h1 class="screen__title">Today</h1>
</header>

<section class="today-welcome" id="today-welcome" hidden>
  <p>Math Direct teaches a child of four to seven to count, read numbers, add, and subtract. You read a short script from your phone, and the child answers. Every lesson, test, and review is planned for you.</p>
  <ol class="how-list">
    <li><strong>Read the script.</strong> Each new skill is shown, done together, and then done alone.</li>
    <li><strong>Mark each answer.</strong> Tap Firm or Error. An error shows you the correction to give.</li>
    <li><strong>Check for mastery.</strong> Every ten lessons, a short test checks each skill.</li>
  </ol>
  <div class="btn-row">
    <a class="btn btn--primary btn--big" href="/placement/">Take the placement test</a>
    <a class="btn btn--secondary btn--big" href="/lessons/">Choose a level</a>
  </div>
</section>

<div data-child-picker></div>

<section id="today-next" aria-live="polite"></section>

<section class="card card--quiet" data-install-card hidden>
  <h2 class="card__title">Install Math Direct</h2>
  <p class="card__text">It opens like an app and works without a connection.</p>
  <div class="btn-row">
    <button type="button" class="btn btn--primary" data-install>Install</button>
    <button type="button" class="btn btn--quiet" data-install-dismiss>Not now</button>
  </div>
</section>

<script id="today-data" type="application/json">{{ program.summary | dump | safe }}</script>
<script src="/assets/js/progress.js?v={{ build.version }}"></script>
<script src="/assets/js/today.js?v={{ build.version }}" defer></script>
